==Trivia==
*HUGE HERMIT's Normal and Evolved Form descriptions originally began with "Recruited from Metal Slug Defense!". They were changed in [[Version 13.1 Update|Ver. 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Ver. 13.7]] for all other versions to reflect the fact that ''Metal Slug Defense'' was no longer the specific game in the series that was being collaborated with.
*Unlike the original Huge Hermit, this one always has its cannon out, a trait only seen in Metal Slug Defense/Attack.
**The only other game it appears in is [[wikia:metalslug:Metal Slug 3|Metal Slug 3]], and in there, the cannon is not shown and only revealed after dealing enough damage to Huge Hermit.

